OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a quite chilly start in
OL,6,Fplaces it will develop to be a dry day
OL,7,Fwith prolonged bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping and light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FDry in the evening with clear
OL,11,Fspells. Turning cloudy overnight with
OL,12,Ffreshening winds and patchy rain late
OL,13,Fin the southwest.
OL,14,
OL,15,CMonday:FIt will be cloudy with mostly
OL,16,Fpatchy light rain by day, but the rain
OL,17,Fturning heavier in the evening.
OL,18,FOccasionally strong winds around the
OL,19,Fcoast. Generally drier in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
