OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FEarly
OL,6,Frain clearing by midday Tuesday, then
OL,7,Fsunshine and showers, windy at times.
OL,8,FWindy Wednesday with coastal gales,
OL,9,Fclouding over with occasionally heavy
OL,10,Frain later, this clearing later
OL,11,FThursday evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
